# Custom Task subagents

This repo ships `.cursor/agents/*.md` subagents. When the trigger matches, **invoke the Task tool** with the given `subagent_type` in the same turn or immediately after your edits. Prefer this over running the same commands inline in the main agent unless the user forbids subagents or the Task tool fails.

- **`intl-l10n-regenerate`** — Use after any create, edit, or delete under `lib/l10n/` (especially `*.arb` or `sources/`) or when `pubspec.yaml` changes `flutter_intl`, `intl_utils`, or related l10n config, or when the user asks to refresh localization.

- **`build-runner-on-codegen-edit`** — Use after any create or edit of a `.dart` file in this package that contains a `part` directive targeting `.g.dart`, imports a generated `*.g.dart`, or uses annotation-driven codegen (for example `json_serializable`, Retrofit, freezed), or when the user asks to run codegen.

Explicit user commands like "run build_runner" or "regenerate l10n" also use these `subagent_type` values.
